      10 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">استخسّهُ</span></b>  <i>He reckoned, accounted,</i> or
<i>esteemed, him low</i> or <i>ignoble, base, vile, mean</i> or
<i>sordid, weak;</i> [or, more commonly,] <i>contemptible.</i>
(S, * K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">استخسّ حَظَّهُ</span> (tropical:)  [<i>He accounted his
fortune low</i> or <i>ignoble,</i> &amp;c.]. (A.)

